<title>UK: BP hikes Oct LPG prices by $45-53/tonne - trade.</title>
<headline>BP hikes Oct LPG prices by $45-53/tonne - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum on Tuesday raised its October liquefied petroleum gas (LPG) prices by $45-53 per tonne against the September price, traders said.</p>
<p>Propane rose $53 to $238 per tonne while butane jumped $45 to $225, they said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
